               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Sorbitol, sodium benzoate, sucralose, citric acid anhydrous, sodium citrate, flavor, FD&amp;C Red No. 40, xanthan gum, glycerin, sodium saccharin, sodium EDTA, water.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20251006"/>
            </section>
